<title>HONG KONG: Hongkong Bank sets US$100 mln fixed CDs.</title>
<headline>Hongkong Bank sets US$100 mln fixed CDs.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Hongkong and Shanghai Banking Corp has lodged a HK$100 million fixed rate certificates of deposit issue with the Hong Kong Monetary Authority Central Moneymarkets Unit.</p>
<p>The 7.90 percent certificates due January 29, 2007 were issued at par. HSBC Markets was the arranger and lead manager.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
